capmkt:DateOfReport contextRef="MainI">2026-11-27</in-capmkt:DateOfReport><in-capmkt:TypeOfActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">Search or seizure</in-capmkt:TypeOfActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:ActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassedBy contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">Enforcement Authority</in-capmkt:ActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassedBy><in-capmkt:NameOfAuthorityFromWhomActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">Central Bureau of Investigation</in-capmkt:NameOfAuthorityFromWhomActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:NumberOfPersonsAgainstWhomActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1" unitRef="pure" decimals="0">1</in-capmkt:NumberOfPersonsAgainstWhomActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:ActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassedAgainst contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1_PersonsAgainstWhomActionsInitiated1">Promoter</in-capmkt:ActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassedAgainst><in-capmkt:NameOfPersonAgainstWhomActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1_PersonsAgainstWhomActionsInitiated1">Mr. Nirmal Kumar Jain</in-capmkt:NameOfPersonAgainstWhomActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:DesignationOfPersonAgainstWhomActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1_PersonsAgainstWhomActionsInitiated1">Managing Director</in-capmkt:DesignationOfPersonAgainstWhomActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:TypeOfCommunicationReceivedForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">First Information Report</in-capmkt:TypeOfCommunicationReceivedForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:NatureAndDetailsOfTheActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">A search operation was conducted by the officials of the Central Bureau of Investigation (“CBI”) at the residence of Mr. Nirmal Kumar Jain, Managing Director of the AFIL on November 25, 2026 it is in connection with bank fraud committed by Star Housing Finance Limited.</in-capmkt:NatureAndDetailsOfTheActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:DateOfReceiptOfCommunicationReceivedForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">2026-11-23</in-capmkt:DateOfReceiptOfCommunicationReceivedForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:BriefDetailsOfTheMaterialContentsOfTheCommunicationReceivedForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">A search proceeding has been initiated at the residence of Mr. Nirmal Kumar Jain, Manging Director of the Company.The search relates to the CBI’s investigation into an alleged bank fraud concerning Star Housing Finance Limited (formerly Akme Star Housing Finance Limited) (“SHFL”), a separate listed company (BSE Scrip Code: 539017). Mr. Nirmal Kumar Jain was formerly a director of SHFL (ceased with effect from December 31, 2021) and had given a personal guarantee in the capacity of shareholder for loans taken by SHFL in the year 2020 and 2021 and the current outstanding of these loans are not material and are fully covered by Bank Guarantee given by SHFL.</in-capmkt:BriefDetailsOfTheMaterialContentsOfTheCommunicationReceivedForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:PeriodForWhichCommunicationWouldBeApplicableForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">NA</in-capmkt:PeriodForWhichCommunicationWouldBeApplicableForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:ExpectedImpactOfActionInitiatedOnFinancialAndOperationalOrOtherActivitiesOfTheListedEntity contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">The Company has no relation with SHFL. The search operation conducted by officials of the Central Bureau of Investigation is not expected to have any impact on the financials or operations of the Company.</in-capmkt:ExpectedImpactOfActionInitiatedOnFinancialAndOperationalOrOtherActivitiesOfTheListedEntity><in-capmkt:DetailsOfAnyAberrationsOrNonCompliancesOrViolationsOrContraventionsIdentifiedByTheAuthorityInTheCommunicationForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">The search was carried out at the residence of Mr. Nirmal Kumar Jain under the provisions of Section 61(2) read with 316(5), 318(4) and 344 of the BNS, 2023. (Cr. No. and Sections: RC0742026E0012 U/s 120B read with 409, 420 and 477A IPC and Sec: 13(2) r/w 13 (1)(a) of PC Act, 1988) (As amended in 2018) for the violations and Bank fraud committed by SHFL.</in-capmkt:DetailsOfAnyAberrationsOrNonCompliancesOrViolationsOrContraventionsIdentifiedByTheAuthorityInTheCommunicationForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:DetailsOfAnyPenaltyOrRestrictionOrSanctionImposedPursuantToTheCommunicationForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">NA</in-capmkt:DetailsOfAnyPenaltyOrRestrictionOrSanctionImposedPursuantToTheCommunicationForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:ActionsTakenByListedCompanyWithRespectToTheCommunicationForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">NA</in-capmkt:ActionsTakenByListedCompanyWithRespectToTheCommunicationForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:AnyOtherRelevantInformationForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed contextRef="I_ActionsInitiated1">NA</in-capmkt:AnyOtherRelevantInformationForActionsInitiatedOrOrdersPassed><in-capmkt:NameOfTheSignatory contextRef="I_Signatories1">Manoj Kumar Choubisa</in-capmkt:NameOfTheSignatory><in-capmkt:DesignationOfTheSignatory contextRef="I_Signatories1">Company Secretary &amp; Compliance Officer</in-capmkt:DesignationOfTheSignatory><in-capmkt:DateOfOfTheSignatory contextRef="I_Signatories1">2026-11-27</in-capmkt:DateOfOfTheSignatory><in-capmkt:PlaceOfOfTheSignatory contextRef="I_Signatories1">Udaipur</in-capmkt:PlaceOfOfTheSignatory></xbrli:xbrl>
